{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-09-07 08:45:00', 'title': 'ALLERGAN AESTHETICS CELEBRATES 100 MILLION SYRINGES OF JUVÉDERM®', 'text': "JUVÉDERM® COLLECTION OF FILLERS CONTINUES POSITION AS THE WORLD'S NUMBER ONE CHOSEN DERMAL FILLER COLLECTION IRVINE, CALIF. , SEPT. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, ALLERGAN AESTHETICS, AN ABBVIE COMPANY (NYSE:\xa0ABBV), ANNOUNCED ITS MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN FRANCE HAS REACHED THE MILESTONE OF PRODUCING AND SHIPPING 100 MILLION SYRINGES OF JUVÉDERM® PRODUCTS GLOBALLY."}